| B-02 | 🔴 | `agent_security/lib/src/credential_manager.dart:353-367` | API key disimpan **plaintext JSON**, tanpa chmod 600, dan `_save()` menelan semua error (`catch (e) {}`). Diinstansiasi runtime (`tiko_runtime.dart:538`). |
| B-03 | 🔴 | `agent_tools/lib/src/api_server.dart:581-588` | `_validateAuth` return `true` bila token kosong → semua route ber-auth jadi publik. Perbandingan token non-constant-time. |
| B-04 | 🔴 | `agent_tools/lib/src/api_server.dart` (`_parseRequest`, field `maxRequestSize`/`corsOrigins`) | `maxRequestSize` & `corsOrigins` dideklarasikan tapi **tidak pernah ditegakkan**; body dibaca tanpa batas → DoS memori bila server diekspos. |
